  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Engineering oversight to road building/upgrading in South and North Kivu in the Democratic Republic of Congo is a component of Roads in the East in the Democratic Republic of Congo Phase II reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;186,052. It works in the following sector(s): Road transport, Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
